<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40279" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμύω</span></b> , pf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μέμῡκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					2.27
				</span></i>
			:—<i>close</i> the eyes, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ βλέφαρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.110
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>close the</i>
			<i>eyes</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.27.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				21.4
			</span></i> (cj.), <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>in Sens.</u>
				17.14
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>die</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
			</span></i><i>Epigr..</i><i><span class="en">
				41.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>wink
			at</i>, in token of assent, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				934
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. intr.,
				<i>close over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ βλέφαρα τοῖσι
				ὀφθαλμοῖσι ἐπιμύει</span>
			<i>close over</i> the eyes, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>SA</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>, Sor.l.c.; <i>close up</i>, of wounds, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.290
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταχὺ τὸν ὄγκον ἐπιμύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					19.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπῑμύοντας ὀλόσχους</span>,
			prob.l. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπημ-</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				870
			</span></i>, cf. Sch. ad loc.</div>
